// Title: Potential Xterm Reverse Shell
// ID: 4e25af4b-246d-44ea-8563-e42aacab006b
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: @d4ns4n_
// Date: 2023-04-24
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Description: Detects usage of "xterm" as a potential reverse shell tunnel
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (process.executable like "*_xterm*" and process.command_line like "*_-display*" and process.command_line endswith ":1")
